# Project brief

Save this as `MY_PROJECT.md` at the project root, or provide the same information in your request. Only the goal is required; use existing sources and reasonable reversible defaults for unspecified details.

## Goal

Who needs what useful result? Describe the entry and an example of success.

## Existing project and sources

Link original requirements, code, designs and relevant current behavior. Identify conflicting or authoritative editions when known.

## Constraints and targets

Name required platforms, actual environments, data to retain, delivery dates/budget and important non-goals. Distinguish new/disposable targets from existing/live systems.

## Authority and decisions

Say whether you want review, planning or implementation. Name any required stop, reserved decision or authorized external action. List missing access/materials and accepted choices so they are not asked again.

## First useful proof

Describe a representative success and a failure/recovery worth testing, if known. For visual work include references or desired intent. Unknown details can remain explicit.
